@internal/sdl
// Pure-Xu SDL backend. While native.xun is present the C driver still wins
// at import time; remove native.xun / native.c / *.h to activate this package.
//
// Public entry points are defined in loader.xu / window.xu / events.xu /
// input.xu / gpu_stub.xu and match the former native.json surface used by
// #gpu and #window via `driver #internal/sdl`.
